msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I heard that the heads of both the Kazama and the Majima families are having"
" a secret meeting at the Kazama Family office in Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "For real? Wonder what they're talking about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"My guess is they're working on rebuilding the Tojo Clan now that the fight "
"with the Omi Alliance is over. They're prolly tryin' to find new leaders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"But I thought the Majima Family left the Tojo Clan and became a construction"
" company. They're out of the Tojo Clan, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"From what I hear, Boss Kashiwagi's going to ask Majima to be the sixth "
"chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"What!? They're makin' Mad Dog Majima the sixth chairman!? Are you shittin' "
"me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"The Majima Family's got to be in trouble after the construction of Kamurocho"
" Hills got canned. Bet you the Mad Dog'll jump at the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Maybe we should switch from the Nishikiyama Family to the Majima Family "
"while we still can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Hey, that's a great idea! Majima Construction here we come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"(Majima sure has fate on his side... He's gaining followers without even "
"lifting a finger.)"
msgstr ""

